<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Big Meadows</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:167-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.174662" lon="-121.679190"><ele>1100.7</ele><name>Skyline Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:skyline-sno-park (OSM way 148323441); confidence: high; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 3640; quote: map 38: SKYLINE SNO-PARK 3640'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.120312" lon="-121.706205"><ele>1103.0</ele><name>Road 42 / Road 260 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 37563808, start of the 'S-42N Road' track, about 0.65 mi south of the Road 58 junction (OSM node 37537779); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: ski 0.6 mile beyond the Road 58 turnoff to Little Crater Meadow, then turn off Road 42 onto Road 260</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.104596" lon="-121.704379"><ele>1060.6</ele><name>Side road to the meadow</name><desc>source: OSM node 2489997839 on 'S-42N Road', 1.40 mi along it from Road 42; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 170; quote: Big Meadows is 1.4 miles from Road 42 and is hidden from view by a narrow band of trees. A short side road through this band suddenly opens onto a magnificent scene</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.099950" lon="-121.703230"><ele>1059.1</ele><name>Big Meadows, north edge</name><desc>source: GNIS Big Meadows (geonames find); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 3450; quote: map 38: BIG MEADOWS 3450'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.097000" lon="-121.708000"><ele>1055.7</ele><name>Big Meadows (map 38 star)</name><desc>source: placed on the meadow floor (DEM 3,464 ft, flat) where map 38 draws its star, inside the meadow's upper arm; OSM wetland node 369015548 lies 0.5 mi farther SW; confidence: low; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 3450; quote: As you ski along the edge of the meadow, the scene changes</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Big Meadows</name><desc>1. Skyline Sno-Park -&gt; Road 42 / Road 260 junction: osm (high), 4.52 mi | 2. Road 42 / Road 260 junction -&gt; Side road to the meadow: osm (medium), 1.40 mi | 3. Side road to the meadow -&gt; Big Meadows, north edge: straight (low), 0.33 mi | 4. Big Meadows, north edge -&gt; Big Meadows (map 38 star): straight (low), 0.31 mi</desc>
